---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: Low-voltage cabling for hotels and resorts, healthcare, senior living, restaurants, retail, and showrooms. Same-day quotes, straight pricing, and a crew on the calendar. Just say HEY.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Low-voltage cabling for hotels, resorts, and the venues around them</p>
      <h1 class="h1">Wiring for<br><span class="nowrap"><span class="rotator" data-rotate="an access point|a phone|a TV|a camera|a workstation|a speaker|digital signage|a POS station|a kiosk|a printer"><span class="rotator__a">an </span><span class="rotator__w">access point</span>?</span></span><br>Just say HEY.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Same-day quotes, straight pricing, and a crew on the calendar. From one drop to every room on the property.</p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--large" href="/say-hey/">Get a quote {% include "svg/arrow.svg" %}</a>
        <a class="link-arrow" href="/how-it-works/">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      {% if site.region %}<p class="hero__region"><span class="stripe stripe--inline" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Serving properties across {{ site.region }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% include "partials/quote-card.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/steps.njk" %}
{% include "partials/proof.njk" %}

<section class="section section--white">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Where we work</p>
    <ul class="chips chips--large">
      {% for v in site.verticals %}<li class="chip{% if loop.first %} chip--primary{% endif %}">{{ v }}</li>{% endfor %}
      <li class="chip chip--quiet">and similar venues</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted">Hospitality is where we started and where we go deepest. The same crews, the same pricing, and the same quiet-hours habits carry straight into clinics, dining rooms, sales floors, and showrooms.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/areas.njk" %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">What we wire</p>
    <div class="grid grid--4 grid--align">
      {% for s in site.services %}
      <a class="card card--link" href="/services/#{{ s.slug }}">
        <h3 class="card__title">{{ s.title }}</h3>
        <p class="card__text">{{ s.short }}</p>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
